{"task_id": "Mbpp/4", "solution": "import heapq\ndef heap_queue_largest(numbers: list[float | int], n: int) -> list[int]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the n largest integers from a given list of numbers, returned in descending order.\n    Handles n=0 and n greater than list size by returning an empty list or all elements respectively.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n\n    min_heap = []\n\n    for number in numbers:\n        if len(min_heap) < n:\n            heapq.heappush(min_heap, number)\n        elif number > min_heap[0]:\n            heapq.heappop(min_heap)\n            heapq.heappush(min_heap, number)\n\n    result = [int(x) for x in min_heap]\n    result.sort(reverse=True)\n    return result"}
