{"task_id": "Mbpp/12", "solution": "def _calculate_row_sum(row: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of elements in a single row.\"\"\"\n    return sum(row)\ndef sort_matrix(matrix: list[list[int]]) -> list[list[int]]:\n    \"\"\"Sorts a matrix in ascending order according to the sum of its rows.\"\"\"\n    row_sum_pairs = []\n    for row in matrix:\n        row_sum = _calculate_row_sum(row)\n        row_sum_pairs.append((row_sum, row))\n\n    row_sum_pairs.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n\n    sorted_matrix = [pair[1] for pair in row_sum_pairs]\n    return sorted_matrix"}
