{"task_id": "Mbpp/9", "solution": "def find_Rotations(s: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the minimum positive number of rotations for a string to return to its original form.\n    Returns 0 for an empty input string as per the design specification.\"\"\"\n    if not s:\n        return 0\n\n    n = len(s)\n    for k in range(1, n + 1):\n        rotated_s = s[k:] + s[:k]\n        if rotated_s == s:\n            return k\n    return n # Fallback, though the loop will always find a match at k=n"}
