{"task_id": "Mbpp/63", "solution": "from typing import List, Tuple, Union\ndef max_difference(tuple_list: List[Tuple[Union[int, float], Union[int, float]]]) -> Union[int, float]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute difference between elements of tuples in a given list.\n    Processes the input efficiently in a single pass to find the maximum difference.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not tuple_list:\n        return 0.0\n\n    # Initialize max_diff with the absolute difference of the first tuple.\n    max_diff = abs(tuple_list[0][0] - tuple_list[0][1])\n\n    # Iterate from the second tuple to find the overall maximum difference.\n    for item in tuple_list[1:]:\n        current_diff = abs(item[0] - item[1])\n        if current_diff > max_diff:\n            max_diff = current_diff\n\n    return max_diff"}
