{"task_id": "Mbpp/96", "solution": "def divisor(integer_input: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the total count of positive divisors for the given input integer.\n    It iterates up to the square root of the integer to find all divisor pairs.\n    \"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    i = 1\n    while i * i <= integer_input:\n        if integer_input % i == 0:\n            if i * i == integer_input:\n                count += 1  # Count the square root once\n            else:\n                count += 2  # Count i and integer_input // i as distinct divisors\n        i += 1\n    return count"}
