{"task_id": "Mbpp/123", "solution": "def _calculate_sum_of_proper_divisors(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of proper divisors for a given positive integer.\n    Proper divisors are positive integers less than n that divide n evenly.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n <= 1:\n        return 0\n    divisor_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n // 2 + 1):\n        if n % i == 0:\n            divisor_sum += i\n    return divisor_sum\ndef amicable_numbers_sum(upper_bound: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of all amicable numbers less than or equal to the provided upper bound.\n    It identifies distinct amicable pairs and accumulates their values.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_amicable_sum = 0\n    found_amicable_numbers = set()\n\n    for a in range(1, upper_bound + 1):\n        if a in found_amicable_numbers:\n            continue\n\n        sum_a = _calculate_sum_of_proper_divisors(a)\n\n        if sum_a > a and sum_a <= upper_bound:\n            sum_b = _calculate_sum_of_proper_divisors(sum_a)\n\n            if sum_b == a and a != sum_a:\n                total_amicable_sum += a\n                total_amicable_sum += sum_a\n                found_amicable_numbers.add(a)\n                found_amicable_numbers.add(sum_a)\n    return total_amicable_sum"}
