{"task_id": "Mbpp/120", "solution": "def max_product_tuple(list_of_tuples: list[tuple[int | float, int | float]]) -> int | float:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the maximum absolute product between numbers in pairs of tuples\n    within a given list.\n    It iterates through each tuple, computes its absolute product, and tracks the maximum.\n    \"\"\"\n    max_abs_product = float('-inf')\n\n    for a, b in list_of_tuples:\n        product = a * b\n        current_abs_product = abs(product)\n        max_abs_product = max(max_abs_product, current_abs_product)\n\n    return max_abs_product"}
