{"task_id": "Mbpp/167", "solution": "def next_power_of_2(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the smallest power of 2 greater than or equal to a given non-negative integer n.\n    Handles the special case where n=0, returning 1.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n\n    n -= 1\n    n |= n >> 1\n    n |= n >> 2\n    n |= n >> 4\n    n |= n >> 8\n    n |= n >> 16\n\n    return n + 1"}
