{"task_id": "Mbpp/259", "solution": "def maximize_elements(test_tup1: tuple, test_tup2: tuple) -> tuple:\n    # This function maximizes corresponding elements of two tuples of tuples.\n    # It returns a new tuple of tuples with element-wise maximums.\n    result_list = []\n    for inner_tup1, inner_tup2 in zip(test_tup1, test_tup2):\n        max_first = max(inner_tup1[0], inner_tup2[0])\n        max_second = max(inner_tup1[1], inner_tup2[1])\n        new_inner_tup = (max_first, max_second)\n        result_list.append(new_inner_tup)\n    return tuple(result_list)"}
