{"task_id": "Mbpp/262", "solution": "def split_two_parts(input_list: list, L: int) -> tuple[list, list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Splits the given list into two parts where the first part has length L.\n    Returns the resulting two lists in a tuple.\n    \"\"\"\n    effective_L = max(0, L) # Ensures L is non-negative for slicing.\n    first_part = input_list[:effective_L]\n    second_part = input_list[effective_L:]\n    return (first_part, second_part)"}
