{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def _factorial(num: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the factorial of a non-negative integer.\"\"\"\n    if num == 0:\n        return 1\n    res = 1\n    for i in range(1, num + 1):\n        res *= i\n    return res\ndef _binomial_coefficient(n: int, k: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Computes the binomial coefficient C(n, k) using factorials.\"\"\"\n    # Assumes 0 <= k <= n, as per the main function's iteration.\n    return _factorial(n) // (_factorial(k) * _factorial(n - k))\ndef even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of even-indexed binomial coefficients for a given positive integer n.\"\"\"\n    # As per critical requirements, input 'n' is trusted to be a positive integer.\n    total_sum = 0\n    for k in range(0, n + 1):\n        if k % 2 == 0:  # Check if k is an even index\n            total_sum += _binomial_coefficient(n, k)\n    return total_sum"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/267", "solution": "def square_Sum(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of the squares of the first n odd natural numbers.\n    It iterates through the first n odd numbers, squares each, and sums them.\n    \"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        odd_number = 2 * i - 1\n        total_sum += odd_number * odd_number\n    return total_sum"}
