{"task_id": "Mbpp/283", "solution": "def validate(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Checks if the frequency of each digit in an integer is less than or equal to the digit itself.\n    Returns True if the condition holds for all unique digits, False otherwise.\n    \"\"\"\n    s_number = str(number)\n    digit_counts = {}\n\n    # Calculate frequency of each digit\n    for digit_char in s_number:\n        digit_counts[digit_char] = digit_counts.get(digit_char, 0) + 1\n\n    # Validate frequencies against digit values\n    for digit_char, frequency in digit_counts.items():\n        digit_value = int(digit_char)\n        if frequency > digit_value:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
