{"task_id": "Mbpp/293", "solution": "import math\ndef otherside_rightangle(leg1: float, leg2: float) -> float:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle given its two leg lengths.\n    It applies the Pythagorean theorem: hypotenuse = sqrt(leg1^2 + leg2^2).\"\"\"\n    leg1_squared = leg1 * leg1\n    leg2_squared = leg2 * leg2\n    sum_of_squares = leg1_squared + leg2_squared\n    hypotenuse = math.sqrt(sum_of_squares)\n    return hypotenuse"}
