{"task_id": "Mbpp/395", "solution": "from typing import Optional\ndef first_non_repeating_character(input_string: str) -> Optional[str]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first non-repeated character in the given string.\n    Returns None if no character appears only once.\n    \"\"\"\n    char_counts = {}\n\n    # First pass: Populate frequency map\n    for char in input_string:\n        char_counts[char] = char_counts.get(char, 0) + 1\n\n    # Second pass: Iterate through string in order to find the first non-repeating character\n    for char in input_string:\n        if char_counts[char] == 1:\n            return char\n\n    # If the loop completes, all characters are repeated or the string was empty\n    return None"}
