{"task_id": "Mbpp/398", "solution": "def sum_of_digits(numbers: list[int]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the total sum of all digits across a given list of integers.\"\"\"\n    total_sum = 0\n    for number in numbers:\n        current_number_digit_sum = 0\n        number_str = str(number)\n        for digit_char in number_str:\n            if digit_char.isdigit():\n                current_number_digit_sum += int(digit_char)\n        total_sum += current_number_digit_sum\n    return total_sum"}
