{"task_id": "Mbpp/428", "solution": "def shell_sort(array):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list in ascending order using the Shell Sort algorithm.\n    The function modifies the input list in-place and returns it.\n    \"\"\"\n    n = len(array)\n    gap = n // 2\n\n    while gap > 0:\n        for i in range(gap, n):\n            temp = array[i]\n            j = i\n            while j >= gap and array[j - gap] > temp:\n                array[j] = array[j - gap]\n                j -= gap\n            array[j] = temp\n        gap //= 2\n    return array"}
