{"task_id": "Mbpp/445", "solution": "def index_multiplication(tuple1: tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...], tuple2: tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...]) -> tuple[tuple[int, ...], ...]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs index-wise multiplication of elements in two input tuples.\n    It validates input structure and element types before multiplication.\n    \"\"\"\n    _validate_input_structure(tuple1, tuple2)\n    _validate_element_types(tuple1, tuple2)\n\n    result_outer_tuple = []\n    for sub_tuple1, sub_tuple2 in zip(tuple1, tuple2):\n        result_inner_tuple = []\n        for element1, element2 in zip(sub_tuple1, sub_tuple2):\n            result_inner_tuple.append(element1 * element2)\n        result_outer_tuple.append(tuple(result_inner_tuple))\n\n    return tuple(result_outer_tuple)"}
