{"task_id": "Mbpp/471", "solution": "def find_remainder(array_of_numbers: list[int], n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the product of all numbers in an array modulo n.\n    This function iteratively computes the modular product to prevent overflow.\n    \"\"\"\n    current_product = 1\n    for number in array_of_numbers:\n        current_product = (current_product * number) % n\n    return current_product"}
