{"task_id": "Mbpp/566", "solution": "def sum_digits(number: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of the digits of a non-negative integer.\n    Assumes the input is always a non-negative integer.\n    \"\"\"\n    if number == 0:\n        return 0\n\n    digit_sum = 0\n    temp_number = number\n    while temp_number > 0:\n        digit_sum += temp_number % 10\n        temp_number //= 10\n    return digit_sum"}
