{"task_id": "Mbpp/578", "solution": "from typing import List, Any\ndef interleave_lists(list1: List[Any], list2: List[Any], list3: List[Any]) -> List[Any]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Interleaves elements from three input lists of the same length into a single flat list.\n    Returns a new list containing elements interleaved from the input lists.\n    \"\"\"\n    interleaved_result: List[Any] = []\n    # Assumes all three input lists are of the same length.\n    # We can use the length of any of the lists, e.g., list1.\n    for i in range(len(list1)):\n        interleaved_result.append(list1[i])\n        interleaved_result.append(list2[i])\n        interleaved_result.append(list3[i])\n    return interleaved_result"}
