{"task_id": "Mbpp/605", "solution": "def prime_num(number: int) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"Checks if an integer is a prime number according to mathematical rules.\"\"\"\n    if number <= 1:\n        return False\n\n    # Check for divisibility from 2 up to the square root of the number.\n    # If no divisors are found, the number is prime.\n    limit = int(number**0.5)\n    for i in range(2, limit + 1):\n        if number % i == 0:\n            return False\n\n    return True"}
