{"task_id": "Mbpp/626", "solution": "def triangle_area(radius):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the area of the largest triangle inscribed in a semicircle with the given radius.\n    Returns None if the radius is negative.\"\"\"\n    if radius < 0:\n        return None\n\n    # For the largest triangle in a semicircle, the base is 2*radius and the height is radius.\n    # Area = 0.5 * base * height = 0.5 * (2 * radius) * radius = radius * radius.\n    return radius * radius"}
