{"task_id": "Mbpp/639", "solution": "def sample_nam(names: list[str]) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of lengths of names in a list after excluding those that start with a lowercase letter.\"\"\"\n\n    class Name:\n        \"\"\"Encapsulates a single name string, its length, and logic to check if it starts with a lowercase letter.\"\"\"\n        def __init__(self, value: str):\n            self._value = value\n            self._length = len(value)\n\n        def is_starts_with_lowercase(self) -> bool:\n            \"\"\"Checks if the name's first character is a lowercase letter.\"\"\"\n            return self._value and self._value[0].islower()\n\n        @property\n        def value(self) -> str:\n            \"\"\"Returns the name string.\"\"\"\n            return self._value\n\n        @property\n        def length(self) -> int:\n            \"\"\"Returns the length of the name string.\"\"\"\n            return self._length\n\n    class NameList:\n        \"\"\"Manages a collection of `Name` objects, providing methods to filter them and calculate the total length.\"\"\"\n        def __init__(self, names: list[Name]):\n            self._names = names\n\n        @classmethod\n        def from_strings(cls, string_list: list[str]) -> 'NameList':\n            \"\"\"Factory method to create a NameList from a list of raw strings.\"\"\"\n            return cls([Name(s) for s in string_list])\n\n        def filter_lowercase_starting_names(self) -> 'NameList':\n            \"\"\"Returns a new NameList containing only names that do not start with a lowercase letter.\"\"\"\n            filtered_names = [name for name in self._names if not name.is_starts_with_lowercase()]\n            return NameList(filtered_names)\n\n        def calculate_total_length(self) -> int:\n            \"\"\"Calculates and returns the sum of lengths of all names in the list.\"\"\"\n            return sum(name.length for name in self._names)\n\n    initial_name_list = NameList.from_strings(names)\n    filtered_name_list = initial_name_list.filter_lowercase_starting_names()\n    total_sum = filtered_name_list.calculate_total_length()\n    return total_sum"}
