{"task_id": "Mbpp/725", "solution": "def extract_quotation(s: str) -> list[str]:\n    \"\"\"Extracts all substrings enclosed by double quotation marks from a given string.\n    Processes the string to find pairs of quotes and collects the content between them.\"\"\"\n    values = []\n    start_index = 0\n    while True:\n        first_quote_idx = s.find('\"', start_index)\n        if first_quote_idx == -1:\n            break\n        second_quote_idx = s.find('\"', first_quote_idx + 1)\n        if second_quote_idx == -1:\n            break\n        values.append(s[first_quote_idx + 1 : second_quote_idx])\n        start_index = second_quote_idx + 1\n    return values"}
