{"task_id": "Mbpp/644", "solution": "def reverse_Array_Upto_K(arr: list, k: int) -> list:\n    \"\"\"Reverses the elements of an array from the beginning up to position k-1.\n    A new list is returned with the specified portion reversed, leaving the original array unchanged.\n    \"\"\"\n    arr_copy = list(arr)\n\n    # Extract the portion to be reversed (elements from index 0 up to k-1)\n    # and reverse it using slicing.\n    reversed_portion = arr_copy[0:k][::-1]\n\n    # Replace the original portion in the copied array with the reversed one.\n    arr_copy[0:k] = reversed_portion\n\n    return arr_copy"}
