{"task_id": "Mbpp/730", "solution": "def consecutive_duplicates(input_list: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Processes a list to remove consecutive duplicate elements, returning a new list.\n    The original input list remains unmodified as per design requirements.\n    \"\"\"\n    new_list = []\n    for element in input_list:\n        if not new_list or element != new_list[-1]:\n            new_list.append(element)\n    return new_list"}
