{"task_id": "Mbpp/758", "solution": "import collections\ndef unique_sublists(input_list: list) -> dict:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts occurrences of sublists within a list, converting them to tuples.\n    Returns a dictionary mapping unique tuple-converted sublists to their counts.\n    \"\"\"\n    temporary_tuples_list = []\n    for item in input_list:\n        if isinstance(item, list):\n            sublist_tuple = tuple(item)\n            temporary_tuples_list.append(sublist_tuple)\n\n    counts_dict = collections.Counter(temporary_tuples_list)\n    return dict(counts_dict)"}
