{"task_id": "Mbpp/786", "solution": "def right_insertion(sorted_list: list, value: any) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Locates the rightmost insertion point for a specified value in a sorted list.\n    Returns the index where the value can be inserted to maintain the sorted order.\n    \"\"\"\n    low = 0\n    high = len(sorted_list)\n\n    while low < high:\n        mid = (low + high) // 2\n        if value < sorted_list[mid]:\n            high = mid\n        else:\n            low = mid + 1\n    return low"}
