{"task_id": "Mbpp/792", "solution": "def count_list(input_list: list) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts the number of direct sublists within the given input list.\n\n    Args:\n        input_list: A list, expected to contain other lists as direct elements.\n\n    Returns:\n        An integer representing the count of direct sublists.\n\n    Raises:\n        TypeError: If the input_list is not a list.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not isinstance(input_list, list):\n        raise TypeError(\"Input must be a list.\")\n\n    count = 0\n    for item in input_list:\n        if isinstance(item, list):\n            count += 1\n    return count"}
